 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "The New Employee is Incredible?"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "신입사원이 이렇게 일을 잘했다고?"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A strange old lady appears before the 31-year-old protagonist, who graduated from a provincial university, has no connections, and no impressive credentials!\n\n\"Buy one for me...\"\n\nThe old lady suddenly thrusts a piece of gum forward, claiming that chewing it will make you smarter, better at work, and even more likable.\n\nThe protagonist, caught off guard, ends up buying it. During a job interview, He absentmindedly swallows the gum, and from that moment on, things start to strangely go His way..."
  },
